  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TwinTransition - Green and Digital Transformation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The TwinTransition project&lt;/b&gt; (TwinTransition - Green and Digital Transformation) supports partner countries and regions to advance their transition to a green and digital economy and society. Its objective is to provide financing, technical and business advisory for innovation support, formalisation and sustainability of green tech (for-profit and non-profit) businesses solutions.    Sustainable, equitable, inclusive, innovative, green and circular digital solutions are identified through appropriate formats (e.g. competitions, hackathons, calls for proposals, calls for expression of interest for EO &amp; AI open source solutions etc.). Selected solutions, from for-profit and non-profit, and public sector, are scaled at local, regional and global level as appropriate and implemented within the context of broader innovation ecosystems.</narrative>
  </description>
